    participant Client as ClientNode
    participant EH as EHentai
    participant Store as Storage
    participant TGChan as TgChannel

    User->>TgBot: 发送画廊链接
    TgBot->>Server: 转发消息(gid/token)
    Server->>Queue: 创建解析任务
    Queue->>Client: 分配任务
    Client->>EH: 请求画廊信息/下载链接
    EH-->>Client: 返回zip下载地址
    Client->>Store: 下载解压重命名并上传
    Store-->>Client: 返回图片/压缩包URL
    Client-->>Server: 回传元数据+URL+Telegraph链接
    Server->>TGChan: 发送缩略图+描述+Telegraph+备用下载链接
```
